============================

ArtLux is a NON-COMMERCIAL project, built and maintained for EDUCATION AND RESEARCH.
It is not sold, not licensed for a fee, and generates no revenue.

This file records the third-party software ArtLux uses, and — importantly — distinguishes
the two kinds of use, because they carry very different obligations:

  · LINKED INTO A BINARY WE DISTRIBUTE   → copyleft obligations attach.
  · LOADED AT RUNTIME / NOT REDISTRIBUTED → they generally do not.

