    tier (if any) applies; it does not, by itself, remove the obligation to pick one.

  libspatialaudio 0.4.0             https://github.com/videolabs/libspatialaudio
    Ambisonic encoding + binaural (HRTF) and speaker-array decoding.
    Licence: LGPL-2.1-or-later.
